1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:16,900
Meet QuakeLogic HVSR Studio: a standalone desktop application for horizontal to vertical spectral ratio analysis. There's no account to create and no internet connection needed. Everything runs right on your own computer.

2
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:30,870
Your work lives in projects. Each project keeps its stations, recordings, analyses and reports together in one local folder, so backing up or sharing a survey is as simple as copying a folder.

3
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:53,770
Bringing data in is easy. Drop in text, CSV, MiniSEED or SAF files, and the import wizard takes it from there. It detects the delimiter, lets you assign the north, east and vertical components yourself, and checks timing, gaps, clipping and alignment before anything is analyzed. Nothing is ever interpolated or resampled behind your back.

4
00:00:54,020 --> 00:01:12,220
On the waveforms page you can inspect all three components together, look at spectra and spectrograms, and build a processing chain step by step: detrending, filtering, tapering, resampling, rotation. Every operation is recorded, so your results are always reproducible.

5
00:01:12,470 --> 00:01:26,620
Next, choose your analysis windows: automatically, by hand, or a mix of both. Windows are color coded, transients are screened for you, and you can even listen to the recording to catch noise you'd otherwise miss.

6
00:01:26,870 --> 00:01:41,450
Then run the analysis. The engine computes Konno Ohmachi smoothed ratios for every window, and gives you the mean curve, its dispersion band, candidate peaks, and each SESAME criterion, reported one by one.

7
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:47,970
Want to check stationarity? The H over V versus time view shows it at a glance.

8
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:52,570
And the rotate graph reveals any directional effects.

9
00:01:52,820 --> 00:02:03,270
You can also compare your measured curve against a synthetic one from a layered ground model, with Vs30 and VsEq calculated for you.

10
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:15,270
When you're done, export CSV, JSON and figures, or generate a complete PDF report with your logo, survey details and quality flags, in one click.

11
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:25,220
QuakeLogic HVSR Studio. Download it, install it, and start analyzing today. Learn more at quakelogic.net.
